Changelog: 16-10-2026 11:32:38

The Development chapter of the wiki describes the Vita3K Manager's pin beside the other upstream pins: where it
is (emulator.py), where a new build's digest and size come from (its Vita3K-builds release), why the Upstream
workflow does not check it (a build almost daily; the app says when one is newer), and what a new pin needs a look
at in Vita3K's source: the command line, the folders and pref-path, the firmware's three parts, the SDL frontend
and --fullscreen, the AppImage's self-updater, and the config.yml fixture of the pinned build.

